#: data/nation/alaskan.ruleset:3
msgid "Alaska"
msgstr "alaskiska"

#: data/nation/alaskan.ruleset:4
msgid "?plural:Alaskans"
msgstr "alaskaborna"

#: data/nation/alaskan.ruleset:6
msgid ""
"Alaska is a state in the United States of America that was purchased from "
"the Russian Empire in 1867, it became an organized territory on May 11th, "
"1912 and eventually gained statehood as the 49th state on January 3rd, 1959. "
"The question of Alaskan independence became more relevant with the election "
"of Wally Hickel in 1990."
msgstr ""
"Alaska är en delstat i USA. USA köpte området av det ryska kejsardömet 1867. "
"Den 11 maj 1912 fick Alaska ställning som organiserat territorium och den 3 "
"januari 1959 blev det USA:s 49:e delstat. Frågan om självständighet för "
"Alaska fick ökad aktualitet när Wally Hickel valdes 1990."

